{
  "annotations": [
    {
      "start_time": 0,
      "end_time": 5,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The host introduces the premise: a man claims to have had contact with beings from outer space. This frames the segment as extraordinary before the contestants speak."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Opening"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Game Show Format"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Entertainment Framing"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "e59b5cd9-e261-41ca-8da2-91be473c78e0"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 5,
      "end_time": 13,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The three contestants came out from the backstage while a music playing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Opening"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Staging"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Applause or Music"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Entertainment Framing"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Truth Test"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "d534e1d6-13a8-4980-a40c-8be6ef9c2519"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 13,
      "end_time": 23,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "All three contestants state the same identity: \"My name is Charles Hickson.\" The repetition begins the identity game and places the real witness among impostors."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Opening"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Impostor Performance"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Truth Test"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Game Show Format"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Identity Claim"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "fdeb69ab-5c19-4dad-9eb8-912d87d1416e"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 13,
      "end_time": 17,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Before speaking, Number One bit his lower lip. While speaking, his eyes moved from right to left and then back twice (the speaker's subjective direction, the same below). His head moved slightly left and right once, then up and down once. After speaking, he closed his lips tightly. He blinked after \"saying\" Charles\"."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Contestant 1"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Eye Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Head Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Blink"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Lip Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Facial Expression"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Body Language"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "d8bd5cc4-57d7-40f6-a357-3ee500f10a9d"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 18,
      "end_time": 21,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "When Number Two begins to speak, his head, eyes, and eyebrows all move upwards. Then his eyes move slightly to the right, and his eyebrows move up and down slightly throughout the process. After he finishes speaking, his head falls back down, and his lips are relaxed. He blinked after \"saying\" Charles\"."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Contestant 2"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Eye Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Eyebrow Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Head Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Blink"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Lip Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Facial Expression"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "0911c12c-c612-4a6b-aa4e-a80e22bdc700"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 21,
      "end_time": 23,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Number three binked two times before he say \"my name\". His eyes and head moved to the left while saying \"Hickson\", and eyes moved back after finish speaking."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Contestant 3"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Eye Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Head Movement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Blink"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Body Language"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "da3bb068-e46c-4db3-9592-70c2387bdb45"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 24,
      "end_time": 99,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The host reads the signed statement attributed to Charles Hickson. Hickson is the named author, but the host voices the testimony, creating mediated testimony."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Signed Statement"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Mediated Testimony"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Event Description"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Compression"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "95b122d3-4719-4db3-b033-e0181e8b9056"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 28,
      "end_time": 36,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The written statement locates the encounter on October 11, 1973, while Hickson was fishing with a young friend."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Event Description"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Friend"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Signed Statement"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "e689189f-fe8b-4dc4-a358-2782ab41c4dd"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 28,
      "end_time": 36,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "None of the three had their legs together; the angle of their feet from widest to narrowest was number two, number three, and number one. Number one had their hands behind their back, while numbers two and three had their hands relaxed at their sides."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Contestant Comparison"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Posture"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Hand Position"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Body Position"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Body Language"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "5a7d15e3-81ac-485c-90e6-8646255a45b6"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 36,
      "end_time": 44,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The statement describes a bright blue flashing object that hovered, landed nearby, and opened at one end."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Craft Description"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Event Description"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Signed Statement"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "2550aab1-01e9-48c4-b563-f43964371684"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 44,
      "end_time": 57,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The statement describes three light gray creatures with wrinkled skin, pointed ears, nose holes, and crab-like claws."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Being Description"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Event Description"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Signed Statement"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "e5918092-540b-4470-a5f8-2948b6d0cbeb"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 58,
      "end_time": 66,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The statement describes Hickson being lifted by two creatures and taken into the craft, while his friend passed out."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Abduction Claim"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Friend"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Being Description"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "83ad138b-5bce-4555-a521-6436ebce5c6a"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 66,
      "end_time": 81,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The statement describes an examination by a large menacing eye and the return of Hickson and his friend to the fishing place."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Examination"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Abduction Claim"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Event Description"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "db216aec-fa03-4702-a924-7d6907221778"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 82,
      "end_time": 99,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The statement mentions hypnosis and a lie detector test as attempts to substantiate the report, ending with a claim that the story remained unshakable."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Evidence Claim"
        },
        {
          "category": "_uncategorized_",
          "tag": "Authority Reference"
        },
        {
