      "end_time": 212,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Peggy Cass questions number two about the large eye, asking whether it was attached to a body, projected, or physically real."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
