      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Number one is asked about the force exerted on him and whether he could resist. He says he had no power to resist and does not know what kept him suspended."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
